                "retweet_count": 38,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I applaud these workers who are exercising their right to organize, a fundamental exercise in democracy. I\u2019m proud of their commitment not to agonize, but to organize. I recognize their effort to unionize and look forward to engaging with \u2066them.\u2069 https://t.co/Ns9o5alfDi",
