                "text": "Food is essential to life, and nutrition is a fundamental pillar of treatment for people with critical and chronic illnesses. It was so great to visit @communityserv in Boston today as they do important work to address food security and improve patient outcomes through nutrition. https://t.co/7tuaD1TKny",
