                "text": "This Mental Health Awareness Month, we must recognize the climate crisis's impacts\u2014 both visible and invisible\u2014on our frontline communities. That's why @RepPaulTonko, @RepFitzpatrick, and I are reintroducing the Community Mental Wellness and Resilience Act to defeat these crises.",
