                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Unionizing is a fundamental exercise in democracy, and it is time the Senate allow its workers to legally form unions. I am proud to represent the first Senate office to voluntarily recognize these dedicated workers in their effort to unionize. Here's to more. https://t.co/wObTTDuso1",
