                "text": "From learning about tribal history with Mother Bear, to hearing about the First Light Oyster Farm\u2019s important work to cultivate shellfish, exercise their aboriginal rights, and clean Popponesset Bay\u2014I had a wonderful time meeting with members of the Mashpee Wampanoag Tribe today. https://t.co/rgzJURgVlC",
