                "text": "Every day, fishermen face demanding, dangerous conditions that wear down their physical and mental health\u2014all while working to put food on American tables. The FISH Wellness Act will help fishing families get the resources they need to stay safe and healthy. https://t.co/UdZxipRl2m",
